# en: Your mind is a new nib and your magic a full well. Exams look small from up here.
desc [22fe52] = 你的头脑像一支新笔尖，魔力像一口满井。从这儿往下看，考试都显得很小。

@state brightwater_want
# en: Wanting Brightwater
