# en: The world has gone a shade greyer since the Brightwater wore off, and you know exactly what would fix it. Sister Amaranth, they say, has seen this before.
desc [8de9cc] = 亮泉水的劲儿过去以后，世界灰了一层，而你很清楚什么能让它变回来。听说阿玛兰斯修女以前见过这种情形。

@state owls_ink_want
# en: Wanting Owl's Ink
name [6de299] = 想要枭墨
# en: Since the ink wore off your magic comes slow and the page swims, and you know exactly what would fix it. Sister Amaranth, they say, has seen this before.
desc [4971af] = 墨的劲儿过去以后，你的魔力来得很慢，书页上的字也在游动，而你很清楚什么能让它变回来。听说阿玛兰斯修女以前见过这种情形。
